{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2022-08-23 11:37:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE ANNOUNCES PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'NORTHBROOK, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ALLSTATE CORPORATION (NYSE: ALL) TODAY DECLARED APPROXIMATELY $26.3 MILLION IN AGGREGATE DIVIDENDS ON THREE SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCK FOR THE DIVIDEND PERIOD FROM JULY 15, 2022, THROUGH OCT. 14, 2022. ALL THE PREFERRED DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE IN CASH ON OCT. 17, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPT. 30, 2022, AS FOLLOWS: \xa0 SERIES ANNUAL DIVIDEND RATE QUARTERLY AMOUNT PER DEPOSITARY SHARE SERIES G 5.625% $0.3515625 SERIES H 5.100%'}